stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OpenForm
    OpenForm --> Authenticate : Citizen opens report form
    Authenticate --> FillForm : Session valid
    Authenticate --> [*] : Not authenticated -> login
    FillForm --> ValidateInput : Enter category, description,<br/>location, attach photo
    ValidateInput --> SaveReport : Server-side validation passes
    ValidateInput --> FillForm : Validation fails -> show errors
    SaveReport --> GenerateRef : Save report, category, location,<br/>image path
    GenerateRef --> ShowAck : Generate unique reference
    ShowAck --> [*] : Display acknowledgement<br/>(reference + status)
